'''Winner:''' [[Angela Murray]]<br>
'''Result:''' Punishment 3 - '''Hard-Boiled Detective'''<br>
'''Description:''' Angela must wear the "Hard-Boiled Detective" costume for a week, a costume originally featured in ''[[Big Brother 27 (US)]]''.
{{nowrap|[[File:US 28 Time Capsule Competition 1.png|350px|thumb|left|Angela inside the Time Capsule]][[File:US 28 Time Capsule Result 1.png|350px|thumb|right|Angela walking out of the Diary Room after<br>receiving the punishment]]}}
