'''Description:''' Devens earned the [[Diamond Power of Veto]], originating from ''[[Big Brother 4 (US)]]''. With this power, he earned both the power to veto one of the nominees and to name their replacement. He was allowed to use the Diamond Power of Veto up to six weeks after obtaining the power.<br>
'''Power Result:''' In Week 6, Devens chose to use the Diamond Power of Veto to save [[Dee Valladares]] and nominated [[Kamu Kirk]] in her place.
