'''Description:''' Dee earned the BB Bribe, originating from ''[[Big Brother 18 (US)]]''. With this power, Dee is allowed to bribe any houseguest $5,000 to make any game move that she wants. It can range from nominating or not nominating specific people, to use or not use the Power of Veto, casting an eviction vote, or throwing a competition. If the houseguest takes the bribe, they must do what Dee asks of them. It can be used once for the entire season.<ref>@ToomsBB_.“[https://x.com/ToomsBB_/status/2084079579774452156 BB Bribe: You may offer one Houseguest $5,000 in exchange for an action that benefits your game. Any Houseguest that accepts the Bribe must perform the action they have promised. The bribe must be for a gameplay move, such as nominating or not nominating specific people, using or not using the Veto, voting a certain way, or throwing a competition. This bribe can be made in secret or publicly. The BB Bribe can be used once and is good the entire game! #bb28]” X, 2 August 2026. Retrieved 2 August 2026</ref><br>
'''Power Result:''' In Week 7, Dee successfully bribed [[Yash Patel]] to keep herself, [[Rick Devens]], and [[Angela Murray]] safe during his next Head of Household reign, unless he had no other choice but to nominate one of them.
