{{nowrap|[[File:US 28 Time Capsule Competition 4.png|350px|thumb|left|Mallory inside the Time Capsule]][[File:US 28 Time Capsule Result 4.png|350px|thumb|right|Mallory and Melody revealing their punishment to the house]]}}
